      "slug": "moss-st",
      "term": "Moss stitch",
      "definition": "Also called granite or seed stitch. Work 1 dc, ch 1, skip 1. On the next row work the dc into the skipped stitch of the row below (into the ch-1 space)."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "One chain at the start of each moss stitch row. Does not count as a stitch."
    },
    {
      "slug": "weaving-in-ends",
      "term": "Weaving in ends",
      "definition": "Threading yarn tails through stitches with the tapestry needle."
    }
